
==============================================================================
0. Weight family and closed form
==============================================================================
  phi_{theta,a,b}(u) = e^{i theta} u^a (1-u)^b ,  a,b > 0
  M_phi(s) = e^{i theta} B(a+1-s, b+1);  at s=1/2+it:
  M_phi(1/2+it) = e^{i theta} B(a+1/2-it, b+1)

